Package: ML.Classification.FeatureSelection
Title: Machine Learning Classification and Feature Selection Pipeline
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Shirley", "Liu", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R interface to a Python-based machine learning pipeline
    for binary and multiclass classification with bootstrap resampling,
    supervised feature filtering, model comparison, classification performance
    summaries, variable selection summaries, and feature stability visualization.
    The package uses reticulate to manage Python dependencies and run the
    bundled Python pipeline from R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Imports: 
    reticulate
